  "native_query": true,
  "local_query": true,
  "notes": "SendGrid's official careers page hands off to Twilio's Eightfold PCSX board at jobs.twilio.com (Twilio owns SendGrid). The listing is GET https://jobs.twilio.com/api/pcsx/search with domain=twilio.com, query, location, start and sort_by; facet filters use filter_<filterName> (verified filter_custom_department). filterDef.smartFilters declares job_location, work_location_option, custom_department and seniority. There is no separate country filter. Query \"SendGrid\" returns 2 SendGrid-titled roles, so the keyword is a real probe and the full Twilio board is the membership source.",
